
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Free online unit converters for length, weight, temperature, speed and volume.">
<title>Unit Converters — Toolnes</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#f7f8fc;color:#20243a}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
header{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e9eaf2}
nav{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.logo{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#6558d3}
nav a:last-child{color:#6558d3;font-weight:700}
main{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:50px 24px 70px}
.hero{text-align:center;margin-bottom:35px}
h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,44px);margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:-1px}
.hero p{color:#697087;line-height:1.7;font-size:16px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:23px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e9eaf2;border-radius:16px;min-height:180px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(35,39,75,.05);transition:.2s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#c9c2ff}
.icon{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;background:#eeecff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px}
h2{font-size:18px;margin:0}
.card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#697087;margin:0;flex:1}
.link{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#6558d3}
.back{display:inline-block;margin-top:30px;color:#6558d3;font-weight:700}
footer{text-align:center;padding:24px;background:white;border-top:1px solid #e9eaf2;color:#697087;font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:750px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
@media(max-width:480px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}main{padding:35px 17px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<nav>
<a class="logo" href="/">Toolnes</a>
<a href="/">← Back to Home</a>
</nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
<h1>Free Unit Converters</h1>
<p>Convert measurements quickly and easily with our free online tools. Choose a converter below to get started.</p>
</section>

<section class="grid">
<a class="card" href="/converters/length/">
<div class="icon">📏</div>
<h2>Length Converter</h2>
<p>Convert millimeters, centimeters, meters, kilometers, inches, feet and more.</p>
<span class="link">Open converter →</span>
</a>

<a class="card" href="/converters/weight/">
<div class="icon">⚖️</div>
<h2>Weight Converter</h2>
<p>Convert milligrams, grams, kilograms, ounces, pounds and tons.</p>
<span class="link">Open converter →</span>
</a>

<a class="card" href="/converters/temperature/">
<div class="icon">🌡️</div>
<h2>Temperature Converter</h2>
<p>Convert Celsius, Fahrenheit and Kelvin instantly.</p>
<span class="link">Open converter →</span>
</a>

<a class="card" href="/converters/speed/">
<div class="icon">🚗</div>
<h2>Speed Converter</h2>
<p>Convert kilometers per hour, miles per hour, meters per second and knots.</p>
<span class="link">Open converter →</span>
</a>

<a class="card" href="/converters/volume/">
<div class="icon">🧪</div>
<h2>Volume Converter</h2>
<p>Convert liters, milliliters, gallons, cups and fluid ounces.</p>
<span class="link">Open converter →</span>
</a>
</section>

<a class="back" href="/">← Back to all tools</a>
</main>

<footer>© <span id="year"></span> Toolnes. Free online tools.</footer>
<script>document.getElementById("year").textContent=new Date().getFullYear();</script>
</body>
</html>
